    ruling of 2026-11-16, not a reading of the page.
  - men_of_arms and occ_group: the class sits under the book''s Robodome heading,
    which names no occupation group. It is a warrior and pilot O.C.C. (Hand to
    Hand: Expert, W.P.s, robot combat) with no S.D.C. or M.D.C. base, so it is
    stored as men-of-arms, the group of the Robot Pilot it borrows its ladder from.
