    prints no later picks.
  - Money: 1D4x10,000 credits in winnings, stored; plus 1D4x10,000 in spare
    parts, kept as prose.
  - Equipment: the arena suit is any M.D.C. body armor painted in team colors,
    offered as a choice of catalog armours; the energy pistol is of choice.
    The backup radio with headset is stored as a walkie-talkie and the duffel bag
    and travel luggage as luggage. A fire extinguisher and a watch have no
    catalog rows and stay prose.
  - Cybernetics: none to start; some add bionic sensor systems.
  - The Famous! M.A. bonus is conditional on the audience, so it is a special
    ability, not a bonuses entry.
